INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-4867-7ab7-12daf02cb96d', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', '**Prompt for DALL-E 3 Image Generation:**

Imagine a futuristic skyline dominated by towering, castle-like structures representing big tech companies. Below, small, anonymous figures navigate a digital landscape, tethered by glowing data chains. The scene is bathed in a cold, blue light, symbolizing control. Platforms float above, adorned with logos hinting at social media and e-commerce. Algorithms swirl invisibly in the sky, guiding attention. The mood is one of awe and entrapment, with a subtle sense of unease permeating the scene. The imagery suggests a modern digital feudalism, where power is concentrated and individuals have limited freedom.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-48ae-7ab7-12daf02cbe90', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'A futuristic landscape where towering digital castles represent big tech companies. Below, pathways made of circuit patterns symbolize the internet, filled with anonymous figures as "digital vassals." These figures, holding tiny screens, walk under the shadow of these immense structures. In the sky, algorithms swirl like invisible puppet strings, subtly guiding their movements. The setting is both mesmerizing and imposing, with a balance of glowing screens contrasting against the cold, metallic hue of the towers. This visual metaphor evokes a sense of awe and unease, capturing the essence of techno-feudalism''s control and influence.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-48f8-7ab7-12daf02cc553', 'Image preview for note "We migrated our image resizing from Cloudflare to `imgproxy`"', '**Image Prompt:**

A sleek server room with glowing monitors illustrating a transition from a cloud icon to a gear symbol, symbolizing the shift from Cloudflare to self-hosted imgproxy. The room is bathed in a calming blue light, with anonymous figures in the background adjusting servers. Gear motifs subtly echo throughout the scene, emphasizing customization and control. A digital flow of abstract binary code streams smoothly across the space, enhancing the theme of efficient, secure internal operations. The overall tone is one of empowerment, precision, and technological innovation.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-c1d6-7ab7-12daf0350089', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', '**Prompt:**

A vibrant digital scene featuring a futuristic sea battle game. Four abstract symbols represent difficulty levels: an insidious hacker, a fierce warrior, a strategic thinker, and a casual player. Each symbol personifies a unique bot, set against a dynamic ocean backdrop with waves crashing. The scene glows with neon lights, reflecting the game''s cyberspace challenge. In the background, a complex network of digital code weaves through the mist, representing the sophisticated game logic and technical prowess. The overall tone is competitive and thrilling, inviting players to engage in this high-tech maritime confrontation.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-c22d-7ab7-12daf03505ac', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', '**Prompt:**

In a vibrant digital sea, a naval battle unfolds beneath a stormy sky. Symbolic ships engage in a strategic dance, representing different AI difficulty levels—Hacker, Hard, Average, Easy. Each ship displays unique, abstract designs to symbolize their challenge level. Amidst turbulent waves, a glowing control panel signifies pure Go (Golang) technology driving the action. The scene conveys excitement and strategy, with a backdrop of swirling clouds and churning ocean waves, capturing the thrill of testing skills against formidable opponents in a game.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-c2ad-7ab7-12daf0350d93', 'Image preview for note "We migrated our media storage from Cloudflare R2 to self-hosted MinIO S3 Storage"', 'A sleek, modern server room glows softly in cool blue and green hues. Rows of servers symbolize self-hosted infrastructure, with ethereal connections resembling vibrant streams of data flowing seamlessly between them. An abstract, symbolic representation of chains being broken signifies freedom from monopolistic constraints. In the foreground, an elegant, open-source emblem radiates empowerment and innovation. A subtle, shadowy representation of Cloudflare fades into the background, contrasting with the bright, energizing atmosphere surrounding the MinIO servers. The scene captures the essence of technological independence and a newfound commitment to open-source stability.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-c34d-7ab7-12daf03518d8', 'Image preview for note "AI power: finding missing translations through the project"', '**Prompt for Image Generation:**

A serene, futuristic workspace with a digital interface glowing softly in the dim light. An anonymous figure sits at a sleek desk, interacting with a virtual screen filled with swirling, colorful abstract icons representing different languages. A sense of calm efficiency pervades the atmosphere, as tiny, illuminated symbols flow around the figure, symbolizing seamless connection and automation. The room is bathed in a gentle bluish hue, emphasizing a harmony between technology and creativity.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-ce00-7ab7-12daf035bb28', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', '**Title: Strategic Sea Battle with AI Opponents**

Visual Concept: A dramatic sea battle scene under a vibrant sunset sky. In the foreground, an animated fleet of ships, each representing different strategic levels—sleek and high-tech for "Hacker," slightly rustic for "Hard," balanced for "Average," and simple for "Easy." Waves crash in intricate patterns, symbolizing strategic depth. The ocean reflects warm hues, with a mysterious, intelligent robot silhouette overseeing the ships, embodying the AI element. The scene conveys excitement, challenge, and tactical brilliance, evoking the thrill of virtual combat and AI competition.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6876-ce8e-7ab7-12daf035c3ac', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A futuristic data center glowing softly with blue and green lights, symbolizing stability and innovation. Anonymous technicians, represented as silhouettes, work efficiently amid sleek servers. Above, abstract digital waves flow smoothly, symbolizing enhanced website performance. The environment is calm and organized, with a sense of accomplishment and readiness for future growth. Soft shadows and warm light reflect a renewed sense of security and progress.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-15ba-41f1-b8f283ed7df1', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Summary: The concept of techno-feudalism describes how major tech companies act like modern feudal lords, controlling digital platforms and setting rules. Users, akin to digital vassals, lack true ownership over their accounts or data. Companies profit through transactional fees rather than value creation, and algorithms dictate user engagement, illustrating a shift away from traditional capitalism towards a concentrated power structure.

DALL-E 3 Prompt: A flat design, minimalistic Open Graph image (1200x630) of a modern feudal castle with technology motifs, surrounded by digital chains and user icons, set against a dark blue background. Using bold shades of blue, silver, and black with soft lighting to evoke themes of control and digital dominance.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-1697-41f1-b8f283ed85f3', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Summary: The article explores the concept of "techno-feudalism," where major tech companies act as modern feudal lords, controlling platforms and user data. They profit by taking cuts from transactions rather than creating direct value, and manipulate user engagement through algorithms. This system centralizes power, resembling historical feudal structures rather than traditional capitalism.

DALL-E 3 Prompt: A flat design, minimalistic Open Graph image (1200x630) of a digital castle symbolizing techno-feudalism, with tech logos as flags atop towers, set against a gradient blue background. Bold colors and soft lighting evoke a sense of modern digital control and dominance.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-27fd-41f1-b8f283eeb7f0', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', 'Summary: The Sea Battle Game has introduced a new mode featuring bots with varying difficulty levels—Hacker, Hard, Average, and Easy—allowing players to practice before competing with friends. This update involved a significant technical effort using Go for backend logic. Notably, the "Hacker" level achieves a 60% win rate in simulated battles, demonstrating the sophistication of the bot programming. The game boasts a 94% code coverage, indicating robust testing and reliability.

DALL-E 3 Prompt: A flat design, minimalistic Open Graph image (1200x630) of a ship battling against digital waves, symbolizing AI bots, with bright ships and binary code patterns, set against a deep blue sea background, using bold blues and whites with dynamic lighting to evoke a sense of strategy and excitement.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-28a0-41f1-b8f283eec3fe', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', 'Summary: The "Sea Battle Game" introduces a new mode featuring bots across four difficulty levels: Hacker, Hard, Average, and Easy. This addition allows players to practice and enhance their skills before challenging friends. The backend logic for the game is developed using Go, with the Hacker bots achieving a notable 60% win rate in simulations.

DALL-E 3 Prompt: A flat design, minimalistic Open Graph image (1200x630) of a digital sea battle game interface, featuring stylized battleships and a bot with varying difficulty levels, set against a deep ocean blue background. Use bold, contrasting colors and soft lighting to evoke a sense of strategy and challenge.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-53f4-5cf6-cd7c542cc6e6', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Summary: The concept of techno-feudalism suggests that big tech companies act as modern feudal lords, exercising control over the digital platforms we rely on. They collect profits through rents rather than directly creating value, limited user autonomy by controlling data, and guiding online behavior through algorithms. This system centralizes power, resembling feudal structures more than traditional capitalism.

DALL-E 3 Prompt: A flat design, minimalistic Open Graph image (1200x630) of a digital castle with giant tech logos as flags, surrounded by users depicted as small, distant silhouettes, set against a dark blue night sky. The scene uses bold colors and high contrast lighting to evoke a theme of control and power in the digital age.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-6402-28ca-0aab595e4ada', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Create an Open Graph image of a digital landscape that visually represents "Techno-Feudalism." Start with a digital skyline of towering tech company buildings (like castles) symbolizing "new feudal lords," each with logos resembling abstract tech symbols (ensuring no real logos). Include pathways branching out from these towers symbolizing "platforms" for communication, work, and commerce, drawn like interconnected digital networks. Incorporate silhouettes of diverse people connected by glowing data streams, representing "digital vassals" under tech influence. 

Arrange the central tech tower prominently within the center 500x500px to retain visibility in social media crops. The style should be a professional, clean digital illustration with sharp lines and a modern aesthetic. Use a color palette of deep blue, metallic silver, and vibrant green to evoke themes of technology, sterility, and artificiality. Create a moody atmosphere with glowing neon highlights suggesting digital control. Emphasize contrast between light and shadow for visibility on small screens. Leave a 5% margin on all sides for branding purposes and avoid text to keep it visually focused. Maintain compliance with DALL-E 3 by avoiding real-human features, political figures, and mature content. Focus on abstract concepts and elements.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-6471-28ca-0aab595e5439', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Create an Open Graph image with the following details:

1. **VISUAL CONCEPTS**: 
   - A large, imposing digital castle symbolizing tech companies as modern feudal lords.
   - Icons or silhouettes of common tech symbols (like app logos) around the castle as "vassals".
   - Chains subtly wrapping around a globe to signify lack of control.
   - Abstract representation of algorithms as a network of lines or grids subtly directing arrows or dots.

2. **COMPOSITION**: 
   - Place the digital castle centrally, ensuring it is the focal point.
   - Position tech symbols and chains around the castle within the frame ensuring visibility within the center 500x500px area.
   - Overlay the algorithm network gently over the entire composition, ensuring it does not obstruct key elements.

3. **STYLE**:
   - Professional and clean digital illustration with clear lines and defined shapes.
   - Use modern and minimalistic design elements to represent the tech era.

4. **COLOR PALETTE**:
   - Cool blues and grays to convey a digital, tech-focused atmosphere.
   - Accents of metallic silver or gold to suggest power and wealth.

5. **LIGHTING & MOOD**:
   - Soft, glowing highlights to give a futuristic and slightly mysterious aura.
   - Create a balanced mood, neither too bright nor too dark, to maintain professionalism.

6. **CONTRAST**:
   - Ensure the castle, tech symbols, and chains have strong contrast against the background for clarity on small screens.

7. **BRANDING SPACE**:
   - Leave a 5% margin around the entire image clear of design elements for potential branding overlays.

8. **TEXT POLICY**:
   - Avoid text to keep the image universally interpretable and focused on visual storytelling.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-6577-28ca-0aab595e6b1d', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', '**DALL-E 3 Image Generation Prompt:**

Create a digital illustration titled "Techno-Feudalism." Visualize a futuristic, abstract concept where a giant, glowing tech company tower emerges as a modern castle on the left side, representing the "new feudal lords." On the right side, a series of interconnected digital vassals—stylized human icons with pixelated, chain-linked connections to the tower. Add a flowing network of circuitry lines across the image to show control and connectivity. In the center, create a vivid illustration of a gear with dollar signs inside, symbolizing earning from rent.

**Composition:** Position the tech tower and digital vassals to fill the frame symmetrically, ensuring the gear is centrally located within the 500x500px area for visibility. 

**Style:** Use a clean, professional digital illustration approach with abstract and metaphorical elements, avoiding realistic faces.

**Color Palette:** Use a complementary color scheme of deep blue, silver, and soft neon green to evoke a technological and modern feel.

**Lighting & Mood:** Implement a dim, soft glow emanating from the tech tower to create a sense of looming power and control.

**Contrast:** Enhance contrast in key elements (tower, digital links, gear) for clear visibility on small screens.

**Branding Space:** Leave a 5% margin on all sides to accommodate branding without text overlap.

**Text Policy:** Do not include text; rely solely on visual metaphors and objects to convey the theme.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-65ae-28ca-0aab595e6fc6', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', '**DALL-E 3 Prompt:**

Create a digital illustration representing the concept of "Techno-Feudalism." 

1. **VISUAL CONCEPTS:**
   - A large, digital castle with logos of major tech companies (Apple, Google, Facebook, Amazon) as banners.
   - Abstract figures of people connected to the castle with chains made of digital code, symbolizing digital vassals.
   - Overlapping networks or platforms resembling a web, illustrating the platforms we use for communication, work, and shopping.

2. **COMPOSITION:**
   - Central focus on the castle within the middle 500x500px area.
   - Chains represented diverging outwards from the center towards the edges, connecting to the abstract figures.
   - Platforms and networks spreading out across the image, with a clear connection to the central castle.

3. **STYLE:**
   - A professional, clean digital illustration with a sleek, technological appearance.

4. **COLOR PALETTE:**
   - Cool blues and grays with accents of black, to represent control and power.
   - Bright, contrasting digital green or neon highlights to depict the digital realm.

5. **LIGHTING & MOOD:**
   - Dim to medium lighting with a focus on ambient light, creating an atmospheric, slightly dystopian feel.

6. **CONTRAST:**
   - Use strong contrast between the castle and the abstract figures and networks for clear visibility on small screens.

7. **BRANDING SPACE:**
   - Ensure a 5% margin left clear on all sides of the image.

8. **TEXT POLICY:**
   - Include minimal or no text to maintain visual focus and adhere to DALL-E 3 compliance. Avoid realistic faces and any real-world references to people.

This prompt focuses on abstract representations and metaphoric visuals that illustrate the concept of techno-feudalism without using realistic or politically sensitive imagery.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-9a3b-cf61-4e2362619515', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', 'Title: Techno-Feudalism

Description for DALL-E 3:

Create a simple and clear Open Graph image illustrating the concept of Techno-Feudalism. The image should depict digital power dynamics akin to feudalism. In the center, show a representation of a large, modern tech castle symbolizing big tech companies. Surrounding the castle, illustrate smaller, connected islands with icons representing social media, e-commerce, and app platforms such as Facebook, Google, Apple, and Amazon. Use visual metaphors, such as chains or control lines, to signify lack of user control and dependence. Above these, illustrate simple dollar signs and gear symbols to represent revenue from rent rather than value creation. In the bottom part, depict simplified algorithmic symbols like gears or binary codes influencing a human silhouette’s focus. Use a soft color palette with blues and neutral tones for eye-comfort and readability. Incorporate simple, legible text labels like "Digital Lords" and "Vassals" to emphasize the feudal analogy. Keep the overall composition straightforward, avoiding excessive detail for ease of understanding.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-9c13-9da7-77996b13f7a6', 'Image preview for note "Techno-Feudalism"', '"Create a simple SEO preview image for an article titled ''Techno-Feudalism''. The image should feature a symbolic representation of modern technology overlapped with medieval feudal imagery. Include visual elements like a large tech company logo transformed into a castle or fortress on the horizon, with pathways leading to it. Small digital vassals, represented by people holding smartphones and laptops, are walking towards the castle. The colors should be bold and contrasting to capture attention. Incorporate subtle references to essential points like control, rent, and algorithmic influence through small icons or symbols embedded in the pathways."');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-9cb5-9da7-77996b1402a3', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', 'Create an image that represents a simple SEO preview for an article titled "Added Gameplay Versus Bots in the Sea Battle Game." The image should feature an engaging visual of a sea battle scene with stylized ships on a grid-like ocean, symbolizing strategic gameplay. Include representations of four difficulty levels labeled "Hacker," "Hard," "Average," and "Easy," possibly using icons or visual indicators to suggest varying levels of challenge. The aesthetic should be clean and modern, with a touch of gamification, reflecting the article''s focus on the new challenging game mode.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c45a-9da7-77996b16d55c', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', '**Image Description for SEO Preview:** 

Visualize a dynamic and engaging digital illustration serving as an SEO preview for the article titled "Added Gameplay Versus Bots in the Sea Battle Game." The image should feature a stylized battleship engaging in a vibrant naval scene, symbolizing the four difficulty levels: Hacker, Hard, Average, and Easy. Incorporate subtle elements indicating the integration of AI bots, such as digital circuitry or bot icons, seamlessly woven into the waves or clouds. Include a stylized representation of code snippets to suggest the technical backbone of the game, specifically hinting at Golang with its signature mascot in the corner. The overall color palette should be bold and modern, captivating users'' attention, and clearly conveying the innovative and competitive essence of the Sea Battle Game.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c78a-4dc3-6f2d6bcbdd49', 'Image preview for note "Added gameplay versus bots in the Sea Battle Game"', 'Illustration description: A dynamic, modern illustration of a fictional sea battle game interface featuring a stylized sea grid with battleships and submarines. The background is a soft white with deep blue oceanic waves, evoking a tranquil sea setting. In the foreground, geometric icons of a computer screen and a humanoid robot represent the new gameplay versus AI bots. Four distinct difficulty sliders labeled "Hacker," "Hard," "Average," and "Easy" stand prominently on the left, each slider depicted with vibrant colors like forest green, rich purple, warm orange, and coral. A playful, abstract representation of binary code subtly emerges in the sea waves, symbolizing the Go (Golang) programming language used in development, with bits of this code transformed into battleships, hinting at the behind-the-scenes technical challenge. A high contrast, minimalistic design ensures accessibility, with dark charcoal lines defining the objects and golden yellow accentuating key elements like the difficulty labels. The overall layout is clean and balanced, guiding the viewer''s eye from the difficulty sliders to the sea grid and reinforcing the allure of trying out and sharing the game.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c7d0-4dc3-6f2d6bcbe310', 'Image preview for note "🧠 The Impact of Stress on Aggression"', 'Create an illustration that visually represents the article "The Impact of Stress on Aggression," focusing on the interplay between stress and aggressive behavior across different species. Center the composition around a stylized brain, depicted with electric blue neural pathways and highlighted areas showing spots of warm amber to indicate tension and stress response. Overlay minimalist icons: a rat, a baboon, and a human, each positioned near a different part of the brain, symbolizing the species discussed. The rat should be smaller in a corner, biting another rat under soft pink and light coral accents to signify stress-induced aggression. A baboon icon should depict dominance and social hierarchy, with green arrows pointing between individuals for displaced aggression, accented with deep forest green. For humans, use geometric symbols like rising bar charts and an NFL football to represent economic and social stressors, with golden yellow and fiery orange to accent heightened aggression. Set on a clean soft white background with dark charcoal and navy blue for text elements, maintaining a minimalist design with clear focal points and sufficient white space to ensure accessibility and immediate comprehension of the theme.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c85b-ab3a-e538f53adda5', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A modern, professional illustration with a soft light gray background featuring geometric shapes in deep blue and forest green representing a stable, interconnected web infrastructure. Vibrant golden yellow and coral accent elements symbolize growth and resilience, while stylized icons of servers and proxy symbols abstracted in rich purple illustrate the new configuration of Nginx and Traefik handling CDN-like features. High contrast arrows in dark charcoal indicate improved performance paths, with clean typography displaying ''Infrastructure Update'' in navy blue. The composition is balanced and minimalistic, visually narrating the story of enhanced website stability and growth potential following the infrastructure update.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c976-ab3a-e538f53af2d7', 'Image preview for note "We migrated our media storage from Cloudflare R2 to self-hosted MinIO S3 Storage"', 'A modern, professional illustration set against a soft light gray background, depicting a stylized server rack in deep blue and forest green representing the transition to a self-hosted infrastructure. The server is connected to an abstract cloud icon symbolizing Cloudflare, illustrated in golden yellow and coral colors with a crossed-out overlay indicating the migration. Floating above are geometric shapes iconically representing open-source tools, interspersed with warm orange accents to symbolize new opportunities. Dark charcoal text elements read ''MinIO S3 Storage'' alongside arrows showing the transformation from the cloud to self-hosting. This composition, with clean lines and ample white space, effectively narrates the journey from Cloudflare R2 to MinIO, emphasizing autonomy and open-source commitment.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c989-ab3a-e538f53af4ae', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A modern, minimalist illustration depicting the impact of sleep deprivation on cognitive functions. Set against a soft white background, deep blue geometric brain shapes symbolize cognitive processes, with golden yellow clock icons representing time and missing sleep. A series of slightly blurred forest green arrows illustrate impaired reasoning and attention drifting off-course, while the word "Recovery" in rich purple appears in crisp, clean typography. Coral accents highlight areas of delayed decision-making recovery. This balanced composition with high contrast elements visually narrates the nuanced effects of sleep loss, emphasizing variability in recovery and resilience.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c999-ab3a-e538f53af5fa', 'Image preview for note "We migrated our image resizing from Cloudflare to `imgproxy`"', 'A modern, professional illustration featuring a composed transition from Cloudflare''s logo on the left side, depicted with abstract geometric shapes in electric blue and vibrant green, to imgproxy''s logo on the right, represented with deep navy and bright cyan hues, on a charcoal gray background. In the center, a large shield symbol as a metaphor for enhanced security gleams in warm amber, with server icons positioned beneath to indicate self-hosting capabilities. Triangular arrows, in golden yellow, flow from left to right symbolizing the migration process. Go language''s mascot, the gopher, is subtly incorporated with soft coral accents, illustrating the ease of integration into existing infrastructure written in Go. Clean, professional typography displays the words "Image Resizing Migration" in light gray atop the shield, and ample white space creates a balanced, accessible visual composition.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c9d5-ab3a-e538f53afb1b', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A modern, professional illustration on a soft light gray background featuring a large brain icon in deep blue at the center, symbolizing cognitive functions. Surrounding the brain are abstract geometric representations of impaired cognition: a half-dissolved clock indicating distorted time perception, a tangled maze in forest green representing confused decision-making, and scattered question marks in rich purple illustrating lost attention. Warm golden arrows and coral lines suggest pathways of recovery and resilience. Dark charcoal text displays the phrase "Sleep matters" in clean, elegant typography. The composition is balanced with ample white space, visually narrating the impact of sleep deprivation on cognitive abilities and the varied recovery process.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-c9f3-ab3a-e538f53afde8', 'Image preview for note "AI power: finding missing translations through the project"', 'A professional and modern illustration set against a soft white background, featuring interconnected abstract shapes symbolizing code and data flow in deep blue and forest green, with golden yellow lines and nodes representing GitHub Copilot''s AI intelligence. An icon illustrating a magnifying glass in rich purple highlights the concept of search and discovery. Coral accents emphasize key areas, while clean typography spells out "AI Power" in dark charcoal, visually depicting the theme of automating and simplifying the process of finding missing translations through AI. The composition is balanced and clear, with sharp lines and high contrast, creating an engaging visual story about leveraging artificial intelligence for efficient translation management.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ca12-ab3a-e538f53b0097', 'Image preview for note "Self-control is a finite resource."', 'A modern, professional illustration set on a soft light gray background featuring a stylized human brain in deep forest green, symbolizing the frontal cortex. Geometric shapes and icons representing energy, like golden yellow lightning bolts and glowing elements, orbit around the brain, indicating high levels of metabolism and energy consumption. Warm coral hues accentuate the energetic aspects, with concise typographic elements displaying ''Self-control: Finite Resource'' in dark charcoal. The composition includes visual metaphors such as a winding path lined with shopping bag icons in contrasting deep blue, illustrating how willpower is depleted after certain tasks. The arrangement balances minimalism with high contrast, intuitively conveying the concept of self-control as a finite resource driven by the brain''s energy work.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ca64-ab3a-e538f53b06f7', 'Image preview for note "About PFC (Prefrontal Cortex)"', '"A professional, modern illustration depicting the functions of the prefrontal cortex with a light gray background for a light theme. The image features a stylized brain divided into distinct sections, with deep blue geometric shapes highlighting the dorsolateral prefrontal cortex (DLPFC), symbolizing executive functions like working memory and reasoning through interconnected circuit designs. The ventromedial prefrontal cortex (VMPFC) is depicted in forest green, with vibrant golden arrow symbols illustrating pathways of decision-making, risk-reward evaluation, and emotional regulation. Warm coral accent lines indicate the flow of social cognition. The composition includes clean, sharp lines and geometric shapes, such as neurons and circuit patterns, providing visual metaphors for cognitive processes, arranged in a balanced layout that emphasizes the integration of these functions, with minimalistic text elements in charcoal showing ''DLPFC'' and ''VMPFC'' for clear identification."');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ca95-ab3a-e538f53b0ab8', 'Image preview for note "About PFC (Prefrontal Cortex)"', 'A modern, professional illustration with a soft light gray background depicting abstract representations of the prefrontal cortex, featuring two distinct geometric brain sections in deep blue symbolizing the Dorsolateral and Ventromedial Prefrontal Cortex. The Dorsolateral area incorporates symbols of gears and books representing executive functions like working memory, planning, and reasoning, while the Ventromedial area includes scales and heart symbols to indicate decision-making, emotional regulation, and social cognition. Coral and golden yellow accents highlight key areas, with sharp, crisp lines and balanced composition to emphasize the interconnected nature of these brain functions. Dark charcoal typography labels both the DLPFC and VMPFC, creating a clear visual hierarchy suitable for immediate recognition and understanding of prefrontal cortex functions in a visually accessible manner.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-cae6-ab3a-e538f53b1216', 'Image preview for note "About PFC (Prefrontal Cortex)"', 'A professional illustration on a soft white background featuring abstract geometric shapes representing the prefrontal cortex functions, using deep blue for the Dorsolateral Prefrontal Cortex (DLPFC) and forest green for the Ventromedial Prefrontal Cortex (VMPFC). The deep blue shapes incorporate symbols like cogwheels and stacked blocks to symbolize working memory, cognitive control, planning, and reasoning, while the forest green shapes include symbols like a weighing scale and heart to denote decision-making, emotion regulation, and social cognition. The design includes warm coral accents highlighting the interconnectivity and dynamic interaction between these brain regions, with dark charcoal text elements labeling key components, arranged in a clean, minimalist layout. This illustration visually narrates the complex functions and interactions of the DLPFC and VMPFC, conveying the article’s focus on the prefrontal cortex roles.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-cb7d-ab3a-e538f53b1c9c', 'Image preview for note "About PFC (Prefrontal Cortex)"', 'A modern, professional illustration set against a soft white background portraying two interconnected brain icons to represent the prefrontal cortex''s regions. The left icon, in deep blue, symbolizes the dorsolateral prefrontal cortex with geometric shapes illustrating concepts of working memory and planning. The right icon, in rich purple, represents the ventromedial prefrontal cortex, featuring abstract symbols of scales and emotional waves to illustrate decision-making and emotional regulation. Coral and golden yellow accents highlight cognitive control and social interaction elements, while dark charcoal typography subtly labels "DLPFC" and "VMPFC" underneath each respective icon. The composition is clean, with balanced placement and sufficient white space, creating a visual story about the functional diversities within the prefrontal cortex.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-cb87-ab3a-e538f53b1d5e', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A professional, modern illustration set on a soft white background featuring a network of interconnected geometric shapes in deep blue and forest green, symbolizing server infrastructure. Central elements include stylized servers represented as sleek rectangles with warm orange accents, with flowing lines connecting them to signify data traffic. Coral-hued proxy server icons are depicted managing traffic flow with golden arrows illustrating efficient performance. Clean typography in dark charcoal reads "CDN Replacement," suggesting stability and growth. A balanced layout with sufficient white space and high contrast elements visualizes the restored website performance and enhanced infrastructure that supports future scalability.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-cc4d-c6fc-c7f14541f7c7', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A professional illustration on a light soft gray background featuring a series of clean, geometric network nodes in rich purple, representing improved website infrastructure. Vivid coral arrows indicate enhanced traffic flow and optimized performance, while forest green circuit patterns symbolize stability and resilience. The layout follows the golden ratio, offering a visually balanced composition. Navy-colored modern icons signify proxy servers, symbolizing CDN replacement and enhanced site functionality. Warm golden yellow accent lines highlight critical improvements, conveying a sense of robust growth and future scalability, with deep charcoal text elements providing explanatory context.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ed00-11a4-651a6e253703', 'Image preview for note "Refactoring days"', 'A professional illustration with a soft light gray background featuring abstract representations of cascading code blocks and circuits in deep blue symbolizing the technicality of refactoring, accented with golden yellow lines conveying progression and transformation, and clean sans-serif typography in dark charcoal that captures key concepts of version migration. The design incorporates coral highlights to emphasize important aspects of the upgrade process, arranged asymmetrically yet harmoniously using the rule of thirds, which visually communicates the complexity and challenges of transitioning from TailwindCSS version 3 to version 4 in web development through strategic use of clean geometric shapes and metaphorical imagery.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ed43-11a4-651a6e253b8a', 'Image preview for note "Refactoring days"', 'The image features a professional design with a deep navy background symbolizing the theme of technological evolution and complexity in web development. Central to the composition are abstract circuit patterns and digital interface elements in vibrant cyan and electric blue, illustrating the intricacies and technical challenges associated with migrating from TailwindCSS 3 to Tailwind v4. A series of interconnected geometric shapes represent the structure and modularity of CSS systems. Warm amber accents highlight the emotional tone of frustration and persistence during the refactoring process. The layout employs a balanced asymmetrical design adhering to the golden ratio, offering a guided visual path through the refined elements that embody both the past framework and the new. Crisp lines and sharp edges underscore precision and attention to detail in programming, with soft pink highlights suggesting moments of achievement and progress. Sufficient white space provides a breathing space to visually convey the methodical approach needed in such a labor-intensive migration process.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ee05-11a4-651a6e254831', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A professional illustration with a soft light gray background featuring interconnected circuit patterns in forest green representing web infrastructure, with vibrant coral arrows indicating improved performance flow, and geometric shields in deep blue symbolizing DDoS protection and security. The composition follows the golden ratio and includes clean, sharp lines and sufficient white space, guiding the viewer''s eye through a visual metaphor of a robust, scalable network architecture. This image captures the essence of website infrastructure upgrades and stability through abstract representations, with soft orange accents highlighting the new configuration''s capacity for growth.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ee14-11a4-651a6e2548ef', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A professional illustration with a soft white background features abstract geometric shapes in rich purple and deep blue, symbolizing cognitive function and sleep patterns. Curved lines and circular forms represent the flow and disruption of cognitive processes, accented by warm golden arrows indicating the path to recovery. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with a balanced asymmetrical layout guiding the viewer''s eye from the disrupted cognitive state to the path of restoration. Clean sans-serif typography in dark charcoal highlights key concepts such as attention, reasoning, and decision-making, with coral accent elements emphasizing the varying recovery durations. The visual metaphorically depicts the impact of sleep deprivation on cognitive functions and the variability in recovery, presenting an informative and engaging view for a general audience interested in health and wellness.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ee61-11a4-651a6e254ddd', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A professional illustration with a soft light gray background depicting abstract representations of cognitive functions affected by sleep. The foreground features intricately linked network nodes in deep blue and forest green, symbolizing attention, reasoning, and decision-making pathways. These nodes are intertwined with wave-like patterns in warm orange and golden yellow, visually representing the fluctuating impact of sleep deprivation on cognitive abilities. Clean, dark charcoal typography highlights key concepts, while coral accents denote areas of significant cognitive impact and potential recovery timelines. The composition uses the golden ratio to achieve a dynamic balance, intuitively guiding the viewer''s eye across the interconnected elements that metaphorically illustrate the relationship between sleep and cognitive function restoration.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ee73-11a4-651a6e254f27', 'Image preview for note "Infrastructure update: Fixed website performance issues due to absence of CDN"', 'A professional illustration with a soft white background featuring an abstract representation of a stable website infrastructure. Central elements include interconnected circuit patterns in deep forest green symbolizing the replacement proxy servers like Nginx and Traefik. Warm coral accents highlight areas denoting improved stability and growth capacity, while digital interface lines in rich purple represent the newly integrated CDN-related features. The composition uses a balanced asymmetrical layout adhering to the golden ratio, guiding the eye smoothly from data flow representations to stability symbols. Well-defined, sharp geometric shapes are used to reflect technological components, with clean sans-serif typography in dark charcoal displaying key concepts like ''stability'', ''growth'', and ''proxy''. The design effectively visualizes the concept of enhanced website performance and infrastructure reliability through intuitive metaphorical elements.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ee93-11a4-651a6e2551ec', 'Image preview for note "About PFC (Prefrontal Cortex)"', 'A professional illustration on a soft white background depicts the prefrontal cortex''s role in cognitive functions with a geometric brain outline in deep blue, visually split into two sections using forest green hues to symbolize the Dorsolateral Prefrontal Cortex and rich purple shades for the Ventromedial Prefrontal Cortex. This composition includes circuit patterns emanating from each section representing working memory, planning, decision-making, and emotional regulation. Golden arrow lines highlight connections and interactions between these brain regions. The design follows the rule of thirds with a well-balanced asymmetrical composition, maintaining high contrast with dark charcoal text labels for clarity. Coral accent dots emphasize neural connections, encapsulating the complexity and importance of these brain areas in a clear, visually engaging diagram suitable for educational contexts.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-eea3-11a4-651a6e2552fe', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A professional illustration with a soft light gray background highlighting abstract geometric representations of cognitive processes impaired by sleep deprivation. Deep blue circular nodes symbolize cognitive functions such as attention, reasoning, and decision-making, connected by rich purple pathways, indicating disrupted neural connections. Warm golden yellow clock elements represent time and recovery period, while soft coral accents underline the significance of sleep debt and resilience. The design follows a balanced asymmetrical layout aligned with the golden ratio, utilizing clean lines and sufficient white space to convey the science of sleep recovery and its impacts on cognitive function clearly and accessibly.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-687a-ef28-11a4-651a6e255b29', 'Image preview for note "Cognitive functions and a sleep affecttion"', 'A professional illustration with a soft white background featuring an abstract representation of cognitive functions and sleep. Geometric patterns in forest green signify neural pathways, with a central motif of a half-illuminated brain symbolizing the impact of sleep deprivation. Warm golden yellow accents highlight disrupted paths to represent impaired reasoning and decision-making. Subtle coral elements illustrate varying recovery timelines with diverse circular patterns that gradually align, indicating the potential for cognitive restoration. This composition adheres to the rule of thirds, ensuring a harmonious layout that guides the viewer''s eye across a narrative of sleep-related cognitive impact. The visual metaphor effectively communicates the nuanced relationship between sleep deprivation and cognitive function, with legible navy typography providing key context to support accessibility.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6882-a5c1-a2b2-c7e22275b951', 'Image preview for note "Why are scientists cooler than lawyers?"', 'A professional illustration on a soft white background features a stylized comparison between scientists and lawyers through abstract representations. On the left, clean geometric shapes and circuit patterns in deep blue symbolize scientific discovery, with vibrant green accents depicting exploratory paths pushing through limits, visually conveying innovation against the unknown. On the right, a symmetrical pattern of balanced scales and structured lines in rich purple represents the legal field, accented by warm golden orange suggesting maneuvering within human-established boundaries. The composition follows the rule of thirds, balancing the two worlds distinctly yet connected, with sharp lines and moderate saturation ensuring clarity and focus. Sufficient white space provides visual breathing room, while dark charcoal text in professional serif typography subtly labels the contrasting fields, enhancing the theme of curiosity versus strategy. The image captures the essence of the philosophical debate between scientific inquiry and legal interpretation.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6882-a636-a2b2-c7e22275c0f8', 'Image preview for note "Why are scientists cooler than lawyers?"', 'A professional illustration with a soft white background, featuring an abstract representation of scientific innovation and legal systems. On the left, a series of interconnected circuit patterns in rich purple symbolize scientific exploration, contrasting with a geometric network of deep blue gavels on the right representing legal frameworks. Warm coral and golden yellow accents highlight key concepts of creativity and authority, respectively. A central pathway of digital nodes and arrows bridges the two sides, indicating a journey from structured legal concepts to the expansive unknowns of science. The composition is asymmetrically balanced, guiding the eye from the systematic order of law to the boundless possibilities of science, embodying the thematic contrast between them. Crisp lines and ample white space ensure clarity and visual comfort, with professional typography elements in dark charcoal subtly integrated to illustrate underlying ideas of discovery and logic.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6882-a9b5-a2b2-c7e22275fa24', 'Image preview for note "About strong people and the Meaning of Life"', 'A professional illustration on a soft white background depicting an abstract representation of personal growth and resilience. The composition features a central geometric tree form in forest green, symbolizing human development and life. Radiating from the tree are branching pathways in rich purple, representing different life challenges and experiences. Embedded within the paths are warm orange nodes that highlight key moments of insight and wisdom gained. The emotional tone is both contemplative and empowering, with dark charcoal text displaying motivational concepts in clean, professional typography. The layout follows the golden ratio, offering a balanced asymmetry that guides the viewer''s eye through the piece, suggesting the journey of discovering life''s meaning and the strength it requires.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6884-037c-a2b2-c7e22289bb0d', 'Image preview for note "Content as a Virus: The Biology of Ideas in the Digital Age"', 'A professional illustration with a soft light gray background featuring abstract, interconnected geometric shapes in deep blue representing the spread of ideas as digital content, akin to viral behavior. Vibrant coral accents highlight the transformation process, while warm golden arrows signify the evolution of thoughts as they replicate and adapt in a digital landscape. The composition follows the golden ratio with a balanced asymmetrical design that guides the viewer''s eye through each phase of content spread—creation, sharing, and evolution—using clean, crisp lines and sufficient white space for clarity. Subtle circuit patterns in dark charcoal underscore the digital nature of the theme, and minimal text in sans-serif typography emphasizes key concepts, visually communicating the analogy of content as a living virus with a structured visual hierarchy.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6884-0420-a2b2-c7e22289c0ec', 'Image preview for note "Content as a Virus: The Biology of Ideas in the Digital Age"', 'A vibrant illustration with a soft light gray background depicting an abstract concept of information as a living, viral entity, integrating elements of biology and digital media. The image features deep blue abstract shapes representing molecules and media nodes, interconnected with golden strands symbolizing the transmission and replication of ideas. Coral accents highlight areas of innovation and transformation. The composition follows the golden ratio, with geometric diagrams illustrating the lifecycle of digital content akin to biological processes, and clean sans-serif typography in charcoal conveying key ideas about the viral nature of information. The overall layout balances asymmetry, encouraging the viewer''s eye to follow the conceptual journey from biological to digital realms, effectively visualizing the process by which ideas spread and evolve in the digital age.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6884-0452-a2b2-c7e22289c325', 'Image preview for note "Content as a Virus: The Biology of Ideas in the Digital Age"', 'A professional illustration with a soft white background featuring abstract viral patterns in deep blue, representing the spread of digital content as an idea virus. Network nodes and circuit patterns in forest green symbolize the interconnectedness of modern information-sharing platforms like YouTube and Instagram. Warm golden yellow accents highlight key stages of content transformation, from creation to virality, while conceptual geometric shapes suggest the parallels between biological processes and digital content dynamics. The composition uses the rule of thirds with clean, crisp lines and balanced asymmetry to guide the eye through the concept of ideas as living systems. Dark charcoal text in professional typography introduces philosophical and informational concepts, creating an engaging and accessible narrative about the biology of digital ideas.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-6884-04f8-a2b2-c7e22289c7f8', 'Image preview for note "Content as a Virus: The Biology of Ideas in the Digital Age"', 'A visually striking illustration with a soft white background features an intricate network of abstract digital and biological motifs. Deep blue circuit patterns interlace with forest green viral structures, symbolizing the parallel between digital content and biological processes. Warm coral and golden yellow accents highlight points of intersection where ideas transform, echoing the theme of content as a living system. Curved lines guide the eye across the composition, adhering to the golden ratio to suggest fluidity and evolution. Interspersed are simplified icons representing video uploads, social media platforms, and content transformation, with dark charcoal text subtly integrated to convey key concepts. The overall aesthetic communicates the interconnectedness between digital ideas and biological life, utilizing clean geometric shapes and visual metaphors to encapsulate the spread and adaptation of content in the digital age.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-689e-e7b5-9e9e-2e0a003b231e', 'Image preview for note "Populism as a Consequence of Democracy"', 'A professional illustration on a soft light gray background depicting the complex interaction between democracy and populism. The image features abstract geometric shapes and stylized megaphones in deep blue symbolizing political rhetoric, with golden threads representing the emotional ties of simplified promises. The composition includes circuit-like pathways to capture the rapid spread of media messages, accented by coral highlights to emphasize emotional impact and attention capture. Dark charcoal text elements describe key concepts, arranged in a structured, balanced format adhering to the golden ratio, mirroring the theme of political dynamics and the inherent nature of populism within democratic systems. The design uses clean lines, sufficient white space, and high contrast, invoking a sense of order and analytical clarity against the backdrop of complex political discourse.');
INSERT INTO "media_locales" ("_locale", "_parent_id", "alt", "description") VALUES ('en-US', '11111111-689e-e7e3-9e9e-2e0a003b2498', 'Image preview for note "Populism as a Consequence of Democracy"', 'A visually striking illustration with a soft white background, depicting an abstract representation of democracy linked to populism. The center features a geometric tree, with deep blue branches interwoven with circuit-like patterns symbolizing the network of democratic processes. Rich purple nodes at the ends of these branches radiate golden yellow accents, signifying the spread of populist ideas via media and social interactions. Below, forest green roots extend, symbolizing foundational democratic institutions such as media and judiciary systems. Among these roots, stylized symbols of balance and justice reflect the need for strong institutions. Clean, sans-serif typography in dark charcoal introduces key concepts, while coral accent elements guide the eye between sections, illustrating the chaotic yet structured environment in which populism thrives. The composition, balanced asymmetrically following the golden ratio, communicates the complex relationship between democracy and populism, emphasizing the importance of informed citizenship and strong institutions.');

